From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:28:10 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add middleware libraries (overlay/asteroidos)

Package the upstream AsteroidOS middleware used by the shell and watch
applications:

- amber-mpris: MPRIS media control bindings
- mlite: lightweight desktop configuration and dconf abstraction
- mce-dev, mce-qt6: Mode Control Entity D-Bus bindings and headers
- ngf-qt6: haptics and vibration feedback
- timed-qt6: RTC alarm and time management client
- usb-moded-qt6: USB dynamic mode switcher
- keepalive: CPU wakelock and background execution coordinator

The mce-qt6 package builds the Nemo.Mce QML plugin against the target Qt
libraries, without wrapping the Qt apps.
